sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant E as Eleanor
  participant C as Companion (LLM)
  participant K as Core (code)
  participant V as Voice callers (LLM)
  participant P as PCP front desk
  participant SU as Suppliers (12)
  participant N as Nurse advocate

  Note over K: T+0 intake complete, verbal order in chart
  K->>C: Start: introduce, collect address, home, consent
  C->>E: "I'll handle your wheelchair, a nurse is always there"
  E-->>C: Address, home layout, caregiver, consent
  C->>K: intents: confirm_address, give_consent
  par Order track (critical path)
    K->>V: Task: request visit note + SWO from PCP
    V->>P: Verify office, request note + send SWO draft
    P-->>V: "Maria will send by Thursday"
    V-->>K: Facts + quotes, ledger: Maria, due Thu
  and Supplier track
    K->>V: Task: screen suppliers near her ZIP (no PHI)
    V->>SU: New pts? K0001? Deliver? Assignment?
    SU-->>V: Answers
    V-->>K: Facts + quotes, rules commit ONE supplier
  end
  K->>C: Notify: cost (from snapshot)
  C->>E: $283 deductible, then 20%/mo rental, then hers
  alt Eleanor: "I can't afford that"
    C->>K: intent: cost_concern
    K->>N: Patient-lane escalation + context
    N->>E: Warm handoff call
  else accepts
    E-->>C: OK
    C->>K: intent: cost_accepted
  end
  E->>C: 9pm "Where's my wheelchair?"
  C-->>E: Answer from snapshot: "Order due from Dr. Chen Thu"
  P->>SU: Signed SWO + notes to committed supplier
  K->>V: Task: confirm order receipt + reverify stock
  V->>SU: "Did you receive Eleanor's order (ref R-1)?"
  SU-->>V: Received
  alt supplier silent past due
    K->>V: Follow up, then fail over to backup
    K->>V: ORDER_REDIRECT via PCP
  end
  K->>K: Rules: K0001 + assignment + docs + cost accepted
  K->>C: Notify: propose delivery window
  C->>E: "Monday 10-12 OK?"
  E-->>C: Yes
  SU->>E: Delivers chair (proof of delivery)
  C->>E: "Is it working? Fits your doorways?"
  E-->>C: Yes
  C->>K: intent: delivery_confirmed, case DONE
